ACAD_1_SEARCH_ENVELOPE "$(ACAD_IN_SEARCH_ENVELOPE_MINY_ACAD_1)"
GUI OPTIONAL FLOAT ACAD_IN_SEARCH_ENVELOPE_MINY_ACAD_1 Minimum Y:
# ===========================================================================
GUI LOOKUP ACAD_IN_SEARCH_ENVELOPE_MAXX_ACAD_1 <Unused>,0 
